# Root Git Ignore for EVORA Monorepo

# Operating System Files
*.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db

# IDE & Editor Configurations
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml
*.ipr
*.iws
*.swp
*.class
*.log

# Environment variables and secrets (Strictly Ignored)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.local

# Flutter & Dart dependencies & build outputs across all sub-apps
**/.dart_tool/
**/.flutter-plugins-dependencies
**/.pub-cache/
**/.pub/
**/build/
**/coverage/
.widget_preview/

# Android build & local credentials
**/android/.gradle/
**/android/.kotlin/
**/android/local.properties
**/android/app/google-services.json
**/android/app/debug/
**/android/app/profile/
**/android/app/release/

# iOS build & credentials
**/ios/Flutter/Generated.xcconfig
**/ios/Flutter/ephemeral/
**/ios/Flutter/flutter_export_environment.sh
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
**/ios/Runner/GeneratedPluginRegistrant.*
**/ios/Runner/GoogleService-Info.plist

# Desktop platforms ephemeral artifacts
**/linux/flutter/ephemeral/
**/macos/Flutter/ephemeral/
**/windows/flutter/ephemeral/

# Node / Web artifacts (for Worker PWA / Cloud Functions)
**/node_modules/
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*
**/.pnpm-debug.log*
**/.next/
**/dist/

# Repository notes & scratch media
Initial_discussion.md
Initial_Discussion.md
firebase_setup.md
Firebase_setup.md
code_explanation.md
Code_Explanation.md
phase.md
Phase.md
